INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',4,64,'so there''s a spiritual war all around us it doesn''t stop sin is prevalent the devil is on the prow in my own life my my prayer has been increasing and my time in the word of God has been more powerful than it has been in a long time as it''s increasing with my prayer and something happened this Thursday that has been ruminating with me for quite a while so I''ll tell you the story real quick so I was invited by a nice some some good friends of mine to go and watch some basketball at the brewery so I I I took that that invitation uh at face value and I did go and enjoy my time with them and as I was leaving I W was walking to the parking lot which they have now there good parking lot around the corner and I walked past and there was a a a guy in a blue hat that typically is worn by guys that are in a');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',62,121,'typically is worn by guys that are in a gang that represent the color blue and um he was doing something Shady the a woman was reaching in her purse scrounging for money it looked like and I walked up and they were just in a conspicuous or incp whatever a shady looking spot and it seemed like they were shady and so I didn''t make eye contact I just walked past them and I thought don''t make judgments Daniel they could just be normal people doing normal things don''t make those assumptions based on what you see so I walking past and let''s say that''s this is them right here and I walk past them and as soon as I get right here I can still see my peripheral vision and the guy whistles at me not like CU that would be nice I would like oh that''s nice but he whistles like a train like I don''t I it was so loud like it was so loud it shook my eardrum and kind of it hurt I don''t know how he whistled that loud and I and I was like it was so loud too that there was someone walking down the street like');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',118,178,'someone walking down the street like half that''s a long block by the way way down there and I thought he was trying to get their attention it was that loud and I just had already talked myself into this was all normal happening over here I said Woo that was loud and smiled and he mumbled something that sounded kind of tur and I walked a few more steps and kept walking and turned around and smiled again I was like how did you do that that was so loud and he said something along the lines of you whistle like a man I''m like oh okay I needed yeah okay so you do it with your teeth or you know how'' you do that and so I''m just smiling trying to deescalate it because I''m thinking I think he''s mad at me about something and he says something else and I won''t repeat what he says since we''re you know in the house of the Lord here uh but he said some other things of the insinuation that I needed to to man up and uh and learn how to whistle like a man and I''m like oh okay and then the the woman started saying');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',176,236,'and then the the woman started saying something and smiling and trying to deescalate and then I said all right and then uh he started to walk away and as he was walking away you need to keep moving you need to keep moving and start threatening me you need to keep moving you need to be a man and then he''s walking away from me telling me to keep moving while walking away from me and I just look and I I don''t turn to walk away yet I''m smiling still and he keeps walking away and he turns and looks or turns and looks the other way and he''s walking towards the the store away from me I''m like huh that''s really weird so I I''m I''m sensing he''s about to turn back around I''m like all right I need to go ahead and turn and walk away because I feel like making eye contact would maybe re-engage the situation so I turn and walk away and as I turn I I see him do look back and I''m just like all right I''m going to keep walking and I''m going to casually look back to see if he''s looking to come my way again and so he doesn''t he keeps going and as I''m');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',233,287,'doesn''t he keeps going and as I''m processing I''m like that was really weird and I said all right I''m just going to start praying so I just started praying out loud to God and I was like God that was that was weird I don''t like that and I''m just going to be honest with you the more I''m thinking about what just happened I''m getting kind of angry and there was a fleshly desire to want to go and confront the guy and and take matters into my own hands to be honest I wasn''t going to do it okay I wasn''t going to do it Carrie she knows but there''s a desire to do that because that was really wrong what he did I didn''t do anything to him and so this there''s this desire for justice and and I so I just kind of praying it through I''m like well I''m definitely not going to do that that would be foolish but I just kept walking and praying I was like God why did that happen like what''s the point of this is there a point to this or do I just do I just keep going so I''m processing through all this and I''m praying and I''m I really have to wrestle Tamp down on');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',286,346,'I really have to wrestle Tamp down on the the the anger part because I also thought I''m going to circle around see if I can find him and call the police and get to it or you know whatever all kinds of thoughts anyway the good thing is if you go to the Lord with your issues he''ll sort of out so I was in a safe place I was in a season of prayer I go home by the time I get home I talk to Carrie about it tell her the same story and uh I keep processing it and here''s what I''ve learned from that story you ready here''s the takeaways number one be alert and of sober mind because there''s always a war going on we''re foolish if we think that things aren''t always going on around us if if we think if we think that we can just relax if we think that we''re going to get to a point where we don''t have to be alert we''re fooling ourselves we are in a battle we are in a war there is danger all around us so we need to be alert I didn''t say fearful I said');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',343,399,'didn''t say fearful I said alert the second thing is the enemy ultimately has zero power over Jesus I thought it was interesting because as I was processed again I''m not telling this story I didn''t do anything heroic I didn''t even understand what was happening in it I was just I almost feel like God was just protecting me and doing what he did and allowing me to be part of it and then I walked away okay I didn''t I''m not saying I did something great here because I did not but ultimately one of the things that took away was he was threatening me you need to walk away as he was walking away he was threatening me trying to engage me you need to be a man and I didn''t respond in flesh and so in that moment I do believe the Holy Spirit was moving in a way that was protecting me something sometimes from myself but also from the enemy and I we''ve learned through spiritual warfare back a few months ago that the the Demons');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',395,455,'months ago that the the Demons of of Satan working through people can basically only hurl threats at us outside of God giving them freedom to to do something to us so we are protected Jesus is praying for us too and I talked about this this past week too Jesus is praying in John''s 17 God I''m not saying that you take them out of the world but I''m saying protect them in the world and so the enemies that we face out there are not more powerful than Jesus the third thing is responding In the Flesh will always lead to fleshly results so I believe God protected in that moment because I didn''t respond in the flesh I think I probably would have gotten hurt in best case scenario I may have inflicted hurt on him and then now I''m in trouble right that would be best case so fleshly battles lead to fleshly');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',451,510,'case so fleshly battles lead to fleshly results that''s not where I want to be I don''t want to be in that spot where where Daniel''s taking it you know Justice in his own hand in fact one of the thoughts that really came to me because I was feeling like a Vengeance type emotion process through it Jesus says vengeance is mine God says don''t do it yourself vengeance is mine I will repay says the Lord so we want him to do that not me then the fourth one is this the holy spirit is a in walking in Victory if I''m going to walk in Victory I''ve got to be filled with the holy spirit so that God will do things I can''t explain and I''m not I''m not over reading this situation everything I''m telling you is true that of what happened and and the the points that I''ve come to here in this they''re all General enough that I could have pulled them from just the Bible all right but that''s what I experienced in that moment that reminded me that we''re in a battle right now and so what am I doing to prepare for the');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',507,566,'so what am I doing to prepare for the battle am I just going through the motions like normal or am I praying in the spirit am I saying Lord Empower me this the verse came to to mind that night um the today''s title is the sent is repent and believe and we''ll talk more about that in a moment repent and believe the verse that came to my mind that night it says for the spirit God gave us does not make us timid but gives us power love and self-discipline so in that moment that verse was being applied the Holy Spirit was with me hadn''t done anything to to to Cast Away the spirit or to uh to even cause there to be a a distance between me and God but there was no fear I wasn''t fearful in the moment which is odd because some T typically someone yells at you on the street and you''re perceiving them to be a gang member and they''re saying man up you know and walk away and they''re');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',565,624,'you know and walk away and they''re making you you should have seen the fa I can''t describe the face either of this angry person it it''s just but I wasn''t fearful but there was power in the moment I didn''t do anything powerful that was something that he walked away on his own there was love I eventually felt love and in a moment I was like even trying to understand are you are you upset with me is there something that I can help you with and then there was self-discipline to walk away knowing that okay it''s time to walk away the spirit does this so if nothing about what I''m saying is leading at any point for you to feel like it''s appropriate to see the danger and the war around you and walk in fear or timidity we are to be bold in fact the proverb talks about the the wicked flee when no one is pursuing but the righteous or as bold as a what a lion so God is not a weak God and he''s');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',621,680,'lion so God is not a weak God and he''s called us to do something fantastic and what the world would think would be Fantastical or even fantasy that we''re supposed to see a a kingdom or or a Church of God birth that people would believe in this God and so he''s he''s calling us into this and so he gives us power over this and then uh Second Timothy oh this is the next verse of this uh this is 2 Timothy 1:7 and8 that God does not give us power uh does not make us timid but gives us power love and self-discipline so he says so don''t be ashamed of the testimony about our Lord or of me his prisoner rather join with me in the suffering for the gospel by the power of God so this is my hope for us as we go forward and we do alpha starting in two weeks is that we encounter the power of God but for us to do that we have to repent and believe');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',677,736,'do that we have to repent and believe and you may have already repented initially and come to faith in Christ but repentance is not a one-time thing it''s a continual turning away from the world not the people of the world to where we turn our backs to them but turning away from the world''s systems the evil in the world and turning to God by the power of God another verse that came to to mind right along with this the reality is that God is telling us like Peter told uh the recipients of this letter he says be alert and of sober mind your enemy the devil prows like around like a roaring lion looking for someone to devour and I think I think it''s important to understand this is a metaphor the devil isn''t powerful and going to devour you up if you''re in the spirit but he is like one and he''s looking for prey as Christians we are not prey we are his enemy and so we walk in Victory so he is looking for someone to devour');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',734,794,'so he is looking for someone to devour and then he tells us resist him standing firm in the faith because you know that the family of Believers throughout the world is undergoing the same kind of suffering so God is saying the devil is lurking like a lion looking to devour and he says resist them and to stand firm so basically no no I don''t allow you to exercise authority over me no the answer is no resist him stand firm in the faith because you know that you have people all over the world who are suffering for the name of Jesus and it says and all excuse me and the God of all Grace who called you to his eternal glory Christ after all you after you have suffered a little while this God himself will restore you and make you strong firm and steadfast this is what he''s going to do');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',792,851,'steadfast this is what he''s going to do for you this is his promise and because he does it to him be the power forever and ever amen repent and believe we are forgiven through Jesus Christ through his power and today as we talk about repentance repentance is a big word but here''s basically what it means it means there''s a change of Direction in your life I was going this way and now I''m going that way I was following the world chasing the world now I''m following Jesus chasing and seeking the face of the Lord and so this is change of mind and it leads to a change in action my mind has changed my heart has changed so now I''m doing things differently it''s not just I feel sorry about what I did so I want to say I''m sorry and keep doing it it''s I''m sorry forgive me turning away from that I may stumble along the way and kind of look back at the old thing and stumble');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',849,907,'look back at the old thing and stumble but I''m stumbling away from it I''m not embracing this life of sin and saying I''m sorry but not really repenting a change of Direction it''s a change of mind that leads to a change of behavior repentance is something Jesus talked about a lot here''s a few verses says after John was put into prison this is the John the Baptist Jesus went into galile Galilee proclaiming the good news of God and this is what he said the time has come Jesus said the kingdom of God has come near repent and believe the good news first words look in Luke 13 now there was some uh there were some present at that time who told Jesus about the galileans whose blood pilate had mixed with their sacrifices Jesus answered do you think that these galileans were worse Sinners than all the other galileans because they');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',905,963,'the other galileans because they suffered this way I tell you no unless you repent you too will all perish he continues and those 18 who died when the Tower of silom fell on them do you think they were more guilty than the others living in Jerusalem I tell you no but unless you repent you too will all perish so there''s this repentance Jesus is talking about turning away from and turning to God unless you do this you will perish in the book of Acts after Jesus sent the Holy Spirit to fill the church Peter is is preaching and he closes up his sermon this way he says fellow Israelites chapter 2 is fantastic if you want to read the whole sermon it''s very powerful but he''s finishing it up here he says fellow Israelites I can tell you confidently that the patriarch David died and was buried and his tomb is here to this day but he was a prophet and');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',960,1019,'to this day but he was a prophet and knew that God had promised him on oath that he would Place one of The Descendants on his throne seeing what was to come David spoke of the resurrection of the Messiah that he was not abandoned to the realm of the dead nor did his body see Decay God raised this Jesus to life and we are all Witnesses of it so Peter is saying the psalm that we thought David was talking about himself was not about David he was prophesying that Jesus was going to do this and this is who he was talking about we''ve seen him raised from the dead we are witnesses to it exalted Jesus is now exalted to the right hand of God he has received from the Father the promised Holy Spirit and has poured out what you now see and hear it''s interesting doing the Apostles Creed and learning it as as much as I');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1017,1076,'Creed and learning it as as much as I have recently and saying it as much as I do now I I I notice it in sections of scripture often now when I''m oh that''s in the Apostles Creed that''s in the Creed that''s in the Creed at the right hand of God the Holy Spirit he''s poured out what you see now and so he''s continuing on he says for David did not Ascend to heaven and yet he said the Lord said to my Lord sit at my right hand until I make your enemies a foot stol for your feet so Peter''s like it can''t be David and so there''s starting oh yeah you''re right therefore because of all this let all Israel be assured of this that God has made this Jesus whom you crucified both Lord and Messiah so he''s telling them guys you killed God you killed the Messiah you killed the one we''ve been waiting for that David was talking about and when people heard this they were cut to the heart and they said');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1074,1133,'they were cut to the heart and they said to Peter and the other apostles Brothers what shall we do and there''s there''s power in this question like we really messed up what what do we do what do we do what how how do we fix this what do we do and his answer was repent and be baptized every one of you in the name of Jesus Christ for the Forgiveness of your sins and you will receive the gift of the Holy Spirit This Promise is for you and your children and for all who are far off which is be us and for all whom the Lord Our God will call with many other words he warned them and he pleaded with them save yourselves from this corrupt generation and those who accepted his message were baptized and about 3,000 were added to their number that day Jesus said repent and Peter said');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1129,1188,'day Jesus said repent and Peter said when he confronted them with their sin what do we do he said repent and be baptized this is repentance is not something that''s new to the to Jesus or obviously when I say Jesus Jesus I''m talking about his Earthly Ministry he''s always existed he''s the Creator God but before his Earthly Ministry repentance was part of God''s plan in 2 Chronicles when God is talking to Solomon he says if my people who are called by my name will humble themselves and pray and seek my face and what turn from their wicked ways that is repentance then I will hear from heaven and I will forgive their sin and will heal their land John talks about this element of sin that if you just say sin doesn''t even exist he says if we claim to be without sin we''re just deceiving');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1186,1244,'without sin we''re just deceiving ourselves and the truth is not in us but if we confess our sins and confess here is the proper confession of repentance if we confess our sins he is faithful and just and he will forgive us our sins and purify us from all unrighteousness if we claim we have not sinned we make him out to be a liar and his word is not in us so today we''re talking about the Forgiveness of sins this is the part of the Apostles Creed I believe in the Holy Spirit the Holy Catholic Church communion Saints the forgiveness of sin so if you would every week we''ve been saying the Apostles Creed so if you could just stand up we''ll stretch our legs for just a moment after that long introdu C don''t worry the rest of it not that bad um we''re going to read the Apostles Creed together and I pray that this will be all of our confession so let''s read this together I believe in God the Father Almighty creator of Heaven and');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1242,1301,'Father Almighty creator of Heaven and Earth I believe in Jesus Christ his only son our Lord who was conceived by the Holy Spirit born of the Virgin Mary suffered under Pontius Pilate was crucified died and was buried buried he descended to the dead on the third day he rose again he ascended into heaven he is seated at the right hand of the father and he will come to judge the living and the dead I believe in the Holy Spirit the Holy Catholic Church the communion of saints the Forgiveness of sins the resurrection of the body and the life Everlasting amen you may be seated again that''s the Apostles Creed there''s a British Theologian named BF Westcott when we talk about salvation there''s a lot of different emphases that people have for example my tradition is');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1298,1356,'people have for example my tradition is do you know that you got saved when did you get saved and so it points back to a time when you gave your life to Christ and were baptized the moment where you receive salvation there are other parts of Salvation that predate that that salvation predates the fact when we confess it our Salvation didn''t happen when we prayed it happened at 2,000 years ago at the cross that''s where the Salvation happened so there''s different components to it and so we''re going to see uh the Theologian BF Wescott said when asked about when were you saved he said I am saved I am being saved and I will be saved so there''s a past present and future of our Salvation that I want us to to look at today it''s in three tenses past present future of repenting and believing so the first one is this the past salvation past means I''m going back not only to the');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1354,1411,'means I''m going back not only to the Cross but going back to Eternity that before all this started salvation was there because the it was about to happen for us at the cross but Salvation was already provided there was a God who had said before the foundation of the world he was going to call and redeem people through Jesus the cross uh through Jesus on the cross and he was going to offer salvation for all we get this from 2 Timothy chapter 1 says he has saved us and called us to a holy life not because of anything we have done but because of his own purpose and Grace All Points back to God this Grace was given to us in Christ Jesus before the beginning of time so there''s our past salvation God goes back but it has now been revealed through the appearing');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1408,1467,'now been revealed through the appearing of our savior Christ Jesus who has I like this destroyed death and has brought life and immortality to light through the gospel not only do we look back to the Cross but we look back to the very beginning before it all began and salvation was being provided by God so that''s past salvation and the second was present salvation this is more of the the process that we''re going through as God''s children it includes when we came to faith in Christ as well but we see a lot of scripture that leads us to understand that there is a present salvation that''s happening that we are being saved in this moment we were saved we''re being saved so what does it mean by that so in Philippians chapter 2 it says therefore my dear');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1465,1523,'chapter 2 it says therefore my dear friends as you have always obeyed not only in my presence but now much more in my absence continue to work out your salvation with fear and trembling trembling for it is God who works in you to Will and to act in order to fulfill his good purposes so there''s salvation that''s being worked out in us we''re becoming more and more like Christ you could look at this more as sanctification but that''s a part of our Salvation that we''re becoming more like Christ it doesn''t mean we''re getting saved every day but it means that we are being saved we were saved we''re being being saved and we will be saved and that will to make more sense in a moment too uh Paul says to the church at Corinth he says for the message of the Cross is foolishness to those who are perishing but to us who are being saved so we see here this is these aren''t isolated either there''s there''s more examples to us who are being saved it is the power of God so God is actively working the');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1520,1578,'of God so God is actively working the transformation within us I am a better follower of Christ today than I was yesterday I can say that I''m growing in my faith I can really say go back 20 years and say I''m better follow of Christ then I was 20 years ago now I''ve had my ups and downs right but I''m becoming more and more transformed the more and more I allow God to work within me and that''s the same for you that we''re becoming conformed to the image of Jesus we are being saved he is working out his salvation in Us in Acts chap 2: 47 praising God and enjoying their favor of all the people um well that kind of just ended out but and the Lord added to their number daily those who were being saved so it was it was being worked out all right so there''s this active part of Salvation and finally here''s another one');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1575,1634,'Salvation and finally here''s another one there there''s even more for we are to God the pleasing Aroma of Christ among those who are being saved and those who are perishing so we see this over and over I was saved I''m being saved it is appropriate for us to say you know what yeah I was saved but I''m also being saved God''s working out his salvation in me now and I''m being saved salvation is having its continual effect in my life and my key to Growing more in that is my continual repentance and that''s turning away from the ways of the world and turning away from the fleshly way of doing things and saying God no no no not my way but your I want your way let me get out of the way and let you have full Authority and so the third one is if you''ve been listening you know future past present future salvation so this is the part that''s not yet happened we''re awaiting our completion we must go through hardships in life');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1632,1691,'we must go through hardships in life there''s suffering that we will encounter my experience Thursday with that man could have turned out very differently and maybe there was a some suffering that I needed to go through that at that time for whatever reason God had but I''ve gone through some suffering the last few years so I''m kind of hoping I''m on on on the trend upward all right I learned a lot Lord so let''s let''s kind of track that way a little bit for a while if we can but anyway not my will but yours be done so there''s this hardships that we go through and and Peter is talking about there''s this inheritance that''s kept for you in heaven it will be revealed to you in the last time the fullness of our Salvation will come at the return of Jesus until then we''re to learn to patiently endure what we''re going through here not defeat we don''t expect defeat we don''t have to oh I''m just going to');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1689,1749,'we don''t have to oh I''m just going to settle but patiently endure I was saved I''m being saved even in the suffering and you know there''s a full salvation that''s coming so I''m going to hold on tight here Romans chapter 5:9 since we have now been justified by his blood how much more shall we be saved from God''s Wrath through him this is a forward look like when the wrath of God comes down and and delivers Justice that you know a little bit of a raw moment to say I felt like administering Justice to the guy who threatened me you know it is stepping back from the emotions of it it is a good thing for us to desire God''s Wrath to administer Justice and to eradicate this world of evil because there are some atrocious things that are happening in this world I was watching a Animal Kingdom video and I sent it little I wasn''t watching a video I was');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1746,1805,'little I wasn''t watching a video I was scrolling through reels let''s just be honest and this video came up and it was this alligator that came out of the water and grabbed a cheetah by the neck and dragged it into the water and drowned it and the other cheetah were on the like where''d you go where''d he go and then you feels so bad for the cheetah beautiful animal you know you mad at the crocodile where I was the cheetah leaves they have to leave because they can''t you know they can''t go get the guy or their their friend so they go and what do they do next they go kill a warthog I mean it was it was it was brutal and nobody really feels bad for the warthog because they''re kind of weird looking right except the Razer back fans in here we we we have an affinity for the Razer backs but I was just thinking that this is a really brutal picture of nature and that''s just a part of what life is but there''s kind of Next Level stuff not just nature that''s happening but there''s');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1804,1864,'just nature that''s happening but there''s Next Level spiritual warfare is happening that have physical results that are far more atrocious than animals killing each other to eat so he''s saying since God''s done this how much more shall we be saved from God''s Wrath through him for if while we were God''s enemies we were reconciled to God through the death of his own son how much more having now been reconciled shall we be saved through his life it''s like we we''re going to have this fantastic salvation from God I mean while we were his enemies he died for us how much more are we going to be saved from that so may God himself oh that''s a different verse let''s stay right there for a second so more than just the rescue of the sinner''s Soul God is Desiring not just to be saved and go to heaven that''s that''s bad theology Heaven and Earth are going to be remade here that''s good theology that we''ll we''ll go to heaven when we die but');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1861,1918,'we''ll we''ll go to heaven when we die but that''s not the new Heaven and new earth where God''s going to reshape this world and combine Heaven and Earth again like it was in Eden God is saying it don''t doesn''t want us to save our souls but he wants a holistic salvation for us he does want our bodies to be healthy he does want our minds to be healthy he does want our souls to be healthy he does want to have deliverance from enemies deliverance from danger from demons from shame from sin from Death from disability from illness from poverty from Injustice and from hell of course sin corrupts and kills us it corrupts us and kills us and God is ultimately going to bring us full healing now look at first Thessalonians says may God himself the God of Peace sanctify you through and through May your whole spirit');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1917,1977,'your whole spirit Spirit your soul and body body not just my mind my body be kept blameless at the coming of our Lord Jesus Christ the one who calls you is faithful and he will do it sometimes our bodies can be used as instruments of sin and our what shall we do moment when we find we get called out on it or get caught in it what shall we do repent and believe in the gospel turn away because God is going to forgive you I believe in the Forgiveness of sins and Lord I have sinned against you God please forgive me this is probably a daily habit or discipline I won''t say habit a daily discipline is to go and say God forgive');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',1976,2036,'discipline is to go and say God forgive me well I didn''t act out on that thought I had that thought Lord just purify my thoughts forgive me well I did act out on this Lord I I just forgive me for using other people for my glory and not serving them for yours repentance and believing go together believing means I''m committed to something I''m trusting in something I''m believing in Jesus speaking of Jesus it says he who did not spare his own son so God gave his only son but he gave him up for us all how will he not also along with him graciously give us all things he desires to give you good things he desires to give you power in your life not to wield for your own Glory but power to walk victoriously to walk with');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',2033,2092,'victoriously to walk with strength not walking in fear not walking with timidity but saying God is with me not because I''m special but because I''ve repented I''ve turned I don''t have a claim on anything on this world that as mine It All Belongs to the Lord and so I''m walking as your Ambassador I''m walking as your child and you have given your life for me how much more do you not want to graciously give me all things so Jesus gave his life to secure your salvation so our admonition is to turn from the world and turn from these dark forces that are only trying to humiliate us to shout us down they''re trying to destroy you to use you and turn to God who laid down his own life to bring you eternal life so God chose to do this for you long before you even knew he');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',2090,2150,'you even knew he existed and today is the day for us to repent and believe the good news of Jesus that we place our faith in him when he is our Lord we will walk by the power of God''s holy spirit that promise that he gave to the disciples then is for us today so remember this life is a spiritual Battleground you''re supposed to be alert sin is lurking the devil is on the hunt there is strength in your favor though there''s strength and power in the word of God while this Thursday was a reminder for me to stay alert and stay committed to Jesus because there are dangers in the world it was also a very real powerful moment to realize that the enemy''s got nothing on Jesus except empty powerless words so keep your eyes open resist stand firm in your faith and allow the');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',2146,2206,'stand firm in your faith and allow the Holy Spirit to fight your battles for you I wanted to go home start working out doing some weights you know getting bulked up so if that happens again I won''t have to have the Holy Spirit and I thought that''s stupid because no matter how jacked I get that''s not even even if I were to become the strongest oh in Uber store this week I had some guy show me a video they were at a club with Conor McGregor and uh and Conor McGregor has bodyguards so he''s definitely the safest I mean who''s protecting who right Conor McGregor protecting the bodyguards are they protecting him anyway anyway so even if I were to become strong enough to to beat him in a match is that the way God wants me to respond to spiritual warfare the answer is no my power is in the holy spirit it''s not in my strength physically it''s in');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',2203,2262,'not in my strength physically it''s in God''s Supernatural strength which is much stronger this is not just a onetime thing of Salvation in my life but even now day by day it''s a journey it''s a process and there''s a future promise so keep walking the road with Jesus Embrace his forgiveness quickly when you confess and repent embrace it quickly and trust that his grace is there for you turn from Darkness to light keep repenting keep believing and keep living in the power of the spirit because that''s what we''re called to do and remember we''re called to do this together so as we get ready to start Alpha in a couple of weeks I pray that would be where our minds are going that we''re going to go in this together and we''re going to see just how powerful God is and allow him to rewrite our stories and give us strength by his holy spirit''s power amen amen let me pray father we bless you we thank you so much for your uh your word your strength and');
INSERT INTO passages(episode_id,start,end,text) VALUES('51d1acc27137c25fb80b',2259,2298,'for your uh your word your strength and your power so we bless you we thank you so much for a chance to hear um that you give us forgiveness of sins when we repent and so I pray God that would be our posture to you that we would continually be turning away from the ways of the world and we would find ourselves turning to you and embracing you as our King our Lord and our savior so we give you all the praise and all the glory in Jesus name amen');
